{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S12加入“让对方安心”，S13改写了“知道没人能保证永远”的心理依据，S14又加入“不后悔”，部分地方改变了原本人物动机和叙述含义。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键词加亮让我能迅速抓住每段发生了什么、人物情绪转向哪里；感受词按音乐出现，也让我更容易把听到的变化和人物当下的感受联系起来。X的完整叙述在解释人物为什么犹豫、害怕、改变时更充分，逻辑依据比较稳。整体上Y的音乐细节、感受层次和时间对应更细腻，前后反复出现的摇荡、水波、船和声线也让情绪推进更像一段连续经历，而不是几组独立感受。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fc2ed786-928d-4577-a27f-1bd763dcbb4e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T052559798260Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.812, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:27:28.631910+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ff294e0f5d565659dbebc4ce553afd9bcbc10e83ee0a52219775263dae8e0ad6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w